1
00:00:01,164 --> 00:00:02,432
(This drama merged facts with fiction
and plots may differ from records.)

2
00:00:02,499 --> 00:00:03,767
(Children and animals were filmed
with the aid of guardians and experts.)

3
00:00:03,834 --> 00:00:05,035
(Some scenes were made
using generative AI.)

4
00:00:05,903 --> 00:00:07,471
If you think everything is wrong,

5
00:00:07,538 --> 00:00:10,674
what can you possibly change
by doing nothing like you are now?

6
00:00:11,241 --> 00:00:13,076
Will you just watch
as the Jingol nobles...

7
00:00:14,177 --> 00:00:16,847
only feed their own greed
and eat away at this country?

8
00:00:20,551 --> 00:00:22,920
Must we not set Silla right,
even if it means...

9
00:00:23,186 --> 00:00:25,255
we claim power through bloodshed?

10
00:00:27,958 --> 00:00:30,260
Just say that you want to be king!

11
00:00:38,368 --> 00:00:42,639
How dare you speak such high treason!

12
00:00:47,911 --> 00:00:49,046
You weakling.

13
00:00:50,647 --> 00:00:53,116
I should have sent you,
not In Mun, to Tang.

14
00:01:00,090 --> 00:01:01,091
Yes.

15
00:01:02,459 --> 00:01:05,162
I regret remaining here with you
more than anything.

16
00:01:09,199 --> 00:01:11,134
When you smiled at Go Ta So,

17
00:01:12,936 --> 00:01:14,504
was that an act as well?

18
00:01:20,644 --> 00:01:21,678
Beop Min.

19
00:01:26,617 --> 00:01:27,618
Beop Min!

20
00:01:44,868 --> 00:01:45,969
Beop Min.

21
00:01:46,970 --> 00:01:48,572
Are you still wandering, Brother?

22
00:01:51,274 --> 00:01:53,276
Do I look pathetic to you as well?

23
00:01:53,677 --> 00:01:54,745
I know that one day,

24
00:01:55,445 --> 00:01:58,949
you will make up your mind.

25
00:02:01,551 --> 00:02:05,188
So for now, just follow your heart.

26
00:02:13,597 --> 00:02:14,731
It is my fault.

27
00:02:16,233 --> 00:02:17,734
I should have been the one to die.

28
00:02:53,236 --> 00:02:54,805
Why did you slap him?

29
00:02:57,541 --> 00:02:59,109
It must have been more painful for you.

30
00:03:04,181 --> 00:03:08,351
He will come to understand you one day.

31
00:03:09,820 --> 00:03:10,821
My wife.

32
00:03:13,757 --> 00:03:15,726
I am sorry to ask this of you.

33
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,361
However,

34
00:03:19,896 --> 00:03:22,332
you are the only one I can trust.

35
00:03:22,666 --> 00:03:24,668
(Kim Mun Hui,
Kim Chun Chu's wife, Kim Yu Sin's sister)

36
00:03:29,706 --> 00:03:30,707
Arsenic.

37
00:03:30,774 --> 00:03:32,375
(Arsenic: A poison)

38
00:03:33,443 --> 00:03:34,544
Get some for me.

39
00:03:37,614 --> 00:03:38,648
My lord...

40
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:47,023
(Episode 4:
Yeon Gae So Mun and Kim Chun Chu)

41
00:04:27,697 --> 00:04:30,133
I should have just died.

42
00:04:56,526 --> 00:04:57,561
Wait!

43
00:04:59,429 --> 00:05:01,398
Dump that in the pit by the back gate!

44
00:05:06,870 --> 00:05:08,104
Officer.

45
00:05:08,171 --> 00:05:10,707
I was told my child died at Daeyaseong.

46
00:05:10,774 --> 00:05:12,309
Do you know where the body is?

47
00:05:12,375 --> 00:05:14,444
The bodies from Daeyaseong
are just arriving.

48
00:05:14,511 --> 00:05:15,512
Go over there!

49
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:24,554
That is Kim Chun Chu's son!

50
00:05:25,255 --> 00:05:26,389
It is!

51
00:05:29,025 --> 00:05:30,794
(Kim Beop Min, Kim Chun Chu's eldest son)

52
00:05:38,068 --> 00:05:39,069
You bastard.

53
00:05:39,336 --> 00:05:40,804
Why did you come back alive?

54
00:05:41,471 --> 00:05:42,706
What about our people?

55
00:05:44,541 --> 00:05:46,776
I heard
Kim Pum Seok opened the fortress gates.

56
00:05:47,544 --> 00:05:49,079
You and your father...

57
00:05:49,512 --> 00:05:51,448
must have gotten out before then.

58
00:05:52,515 --> 00:05:55,819
My only child is dead.

59
00:05:56,786 --> 00:05:57,988
Because of you!

60
00:05:58,455 --> 00:06:01,057
Because of you wretched nobles!

61
00:06:02,893 --> 00:06:04,594
What will you do now?

62
00:06:05,462 --> 00:06:08,131
- What now?
- Kill him as well!

63
00:06:16,907 --> 00:06:18,141
That is enough!

64
00:06:18,475 --> 00:06:19,476
Stop!

65
00:06:19,743 --> 00:06:22,212
Stop it, all of you! Stop this!

66
00:06:22,445 --> 00:06:23,613
Get off him.

67
00:06:24,214 --> 00:06:27,584
Blame Baekje, not him!

68
00:06:28,251 --> 00:06:31,755
He lost his own sister.

69
00:06:32,122 --> 00:06:34,057
My poor child!

70
00:06:34,524 --> 00:06:36,960
Bring him back!

71
00:06:37,661 --> 00:06:40,130
My sweet child!

72
00:06:48,371 --> 00:06:50,740
Bring me my son back!

73
00:06:50,807 --> 00:06:52,075
Please forgive him.

74
00:06:53,543 --> 00:06:55,845
He is overcome with grief.

75
00:06:56,379 --> 00:06:57,447
Today, I burned...

76
00:07:00,016 --> 00:07:01,751
the bodies of my father and sister.

77
00:07:05,121 --> 00:07:06,856
I can understand your sorrow.

78
00:07:08,458 --> 00:07:09,693
Stay strong.

79
00:07:10,894 --> 00:07:11,895
Only then...

80
00:07:12,662 --> 00:07:16,199
can you protect the poor and powerless.

81
00:07:28,778 --> 00:07:29,779
All right.

82
00:07:31,848 --> 00:07:33,249
I will protect you.

83
00:07:36,119 --> 00:07:37,821
I will surely do so.

84
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:45,895
Keep yourself safe.

85
00:08:11,621 --> 00:08:13,289
Chun Chu is done for.

86
00:08:13,356 --> 00:08:16,526
Our Queen has decided
to shield him no more.

87
00:08:16,893 --> 00:08:18,895
She will hold him responsible
for Daeyaseong's fall.

88
00:08:18,962 --> 00:08:20,230
(Kim Jin Ju, Silla's general, a Jingol)

89
00:08:20,296 --> 00:08:23,400
I doubt it.
Her Majesty would never abandon him.

90
00:08:24,868 --> 00:08:26,503
Last night, Her Majesty...

91
00:08:27,303 --> 00:08:31,474
summoned the Royal Guard
to the Throne Hall.

92
00:08:33,676 --> 00:08:36,246
The Royal Guard is summoned...

93
00:08:36,312 --> 00:08:38,882
only when a minister
is beheaded or dismissed.

94
00:08:39,849 --> 00:08:43,453
Her Majesty is left with no choice.

95
00:09:16,319 --> 00:09:17,353
Chun Chu.

96
00:09:17,754 --> 00:09:20,423
I am the son of an ousted king,
so I have no future.

97
00:09:20,490 --> 00:09:21,524
(Kim Yong Su,
Kim Chun Chu's father, a Jingol)

98
00:09:22,659 --> 00:09:26,429
But our new monarch
cleared our family's name.

99
00:09:28,298 --> 00:09:31,468
You can do much greater things for Silla.

100
00:09:32,602 --> 00:09:33,903
Yes, Father.

101
00:09:36,773 --> 00:09:37,907
Good.

102
00:09:38,675 --> 00:09:40,243
So what kind of man do you wish to be?

103
00:09:40,777 --> 00:09:43,446
I wish to defeat Baekje and Goguryeo...

104
00:09:43,847 --> 00:09:47,016
and make Silla even greater
than King Jinheung did.

105
00:10:24,420 --> 00:10:26,289
"If I were sitting there,"

106
00:10:27,590 --> 00:10:30,226
"Silla would not be in this mess."

107
00:10:32,162 --> 00:10:33,796
"Had I sat upon that throne,"

108
00:10:33,863 --> 00:10:34,931
(Bi Dam, Silla's minister, a Jingol)

109
00:10:34,998 --> 00:10:36,633
"we would have defeated Baekje."

110
00:10:38,234 --> 00:10:40,403
"Had that seat been mine,"

111
00:10:41,971 --> 00:10:44,073
"my daughter would not have died."

112
00:10:49,779 --> 00:10:51,614
Is the throne not too conspicuous...

113
00:10:52,949 --> 00:10:54,817
to hide your ambitions?

114
00:10:58,188 --> 00:10:59,255
That must be...

115
00:11:00,056 --> 00:11:02,325
what you think when you see the throne.

116
00:11:06,663 --> 00:11:09,599
King Jinpyeong replaced
your deposed grandfather.

117
00:11:10,934 --> 00:11:12,735
He named his bloodline royalty,

118
00:11:13,403 --> 00:11:15,872
and demoted yours to nobility.

119
00:11:16,839 --> 00:11:19,442
Well, I suppose...

120
00:11:20,577 --> 00:11:23,580
You cannot help
having such bitter resentment.

121
00:11:30,753 --> 00:11:32,622
I am sorry you lost your daughter.

122
00:11:38,394 --> 00:11:39,996
She was left alone behind enemy lines,

123
00:11:40,330 --> 00:11:43,299
waiting for a father who might never come.

124
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:46,469
How tragic her end was.

125
00:11:49,138 --> 00:11:50,840
However, she must not have known...

126
00:11:52,175 --> 00:11:54,444
that death was coming for you as well.

127
00:11:56,346 --> 00:11:59,249
To save herself,
the Queen must abandon you...

128
00:11:59,983 --> 00:12:01,517
and side with me.

129
00:12:03,119 --> 00:12:06,656
Her Majesty is entering.

130
00:12:08,958 --> 00:12:11,828
I look forward to seeing what she decrees.

131
00:12:29,512 --> 00:12:31,014
This is my command.

132
00:12:34,217 --> 00:12:36,452
Fortunately for us, General Su Se...

133
00:12:37,253 --> 00:12:39,756
prevented Baekje's army from advancing.

134
00:12:42,025 --> 00:12:44,627
Were it not
for Lord Bi Dam's timely commands,

135
00:12:45,028 --> 00:12:47,063
Seorabeol would have also been in peril.

136
00:12:47,130 --> 00:12:49,098
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

137
00:12:49,666 --> 00:12:52,702
I shall not forget how swiftly...

138
00:12:52,769 --> 00:12:54,337
you sent your private troops, Lord Jin Ju.

139
00:12:55,705 --> 00:12:57,573
I am very grateful.

140
00:12:58,341 --> 00:13:01,244
I merely did my duty.

141
00:13:06,316 --> 00:13:09,385
I appoint Lord Bi Dam
as Minister of Military Affairs.

142
00:13:09,919 --> 00:13:12,722
You shall now take control
of Silla's military.

143
00:13:13,456 --> 00:13:17,126
Lords Kim Jin Ju and Yeom Jong
are to assist Lord Bi Dam.

144
00:13:18,961 --> 00:13:20,596
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

145
00:13:27,670 --> 00:13:28,805
Now...

146
00:13:32,041 --> 00:13:34,944
This is my command
regarding Lord Kim Chun Chu.

147
00:13:43,252 --> 00:13:44,454
Lord Kim Chun Chu.

148
00:13:45,588 --> 00:13:47,457
I hold you responsible...

149
00:13:47,890 --> 00:13:51,594
for the miserable loss
and defeat at Daeyaseong...

150
00:13:51,661 --> 00:13:52,695
Send me...

151
00:13:53,663 --> 00:13:55,598
to Goguryeo to meet my demise.

152
00:14:01,070 --> 00:14:02,238
Lord Kim Chun Chu!

153
00:14:02,705 --> 00:14:05,875
How dare you interrupt Her Majesty?

154
00:14:07,744 --> 00:14:11,714
I will go to Pyongyangseong as an envoy
and make peace with Yeon Gae So Mun.

155
00:14:19,856 --> 00:14:21,157
Chun Chu.

156
00:14:23,059 --> 00:14:26,028
You are going to the dark side.

157
00:14:26,529 --> 00:14:29,432
Your Majesty, not only
did he threaten Silla's safety,

158
00:14:29,732 --> 00:14:32,468
he is now being insolent in your presence!

159
00:14:32,735 --> 00:14:34,604
Behead him!

160
00:14:35,271 --> 00:14:36,839
I will speak with Yeon Gae So Mun,

161
00:14:36,906 --> 00:14:39,609
make peace with him,
get reinforcements, and attack Baekje.

162
00:14:40,610 --> 00:14:43,079
Please allow me to defeat Baekje...

163
00:14:44,847 --> 00:14:47,216
and make up for my shortcomings.

164
00:14:50,653 --> 00:14:51,954
Do you not see...

165
00:14:52,288 --> 00:14:56,793
the damage your son-in-law caused
to Silla and the royal family?

166
00:14:56,859 --> 00:14:58,995
Or are you pretending not to notice?

167
00:14:59,462 --> 00:15:00,596
You, an envoy?

168
00:15:02,865 --> 00:15:04,300
This is my command.

169
00:15:04,367 --> 00:15:06,302
I must go to Pyongyangseong!

170
00:15:11,107 --> 00:15:13,910
Go Ta So and her children...

171
00:15:15,344 --> 00:15:17,313
were of Your Majesty's own blood,
just as I am.

172
00:15:19,715 --> 00:15:22,518
Do you know what Baekje did to them?

173
00:15:25,388 --> 00:15:27,056
They beheaded her...

174
00:15:29,625 --> 00:15:31,727
and sent her body back, pickled in salt.

175
00:15:33,496 --> 00:15:35,498
They did the same to her children.

176
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:45,475
I do not wish to live!

177
00:15:46,175 --> 00:15:47,643
I wish to stare down death...

178
00:15:48,444 --> 00:15:50,746
to make up for my mistake!

179
00:15:57,887 --> 00:16:00,323
Yeon Gae So Mun is our enemy.

180
00:16:01,991 --> 00:16:03,226
Would he...

181
00:16:04,093 --> 00:16:05,661
make peace with us...

182
00:16:06,529 --> 00:16:08,064
and lend us his army?

183
00:16:08,364 --> 00:16:10,132
Making peace is what you do with enemies.

184
00:16:12,201 --> 00:16:13,302
Silla is surrounded...

185
00:16:13,970 --> 00:16:16,639
by Goguryeo, Baekje, Tang,
and the Land of Wa.

186
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:19,375
There are enemies everywhere.

187
00:16:20,476 --> 00:16:23,746
Unless we turn one foe into an ally,
we shall perish.

188
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:25,648
Just like Go Ta So did.

189
00:16:28,551 --> 00:16:29,552
Please...

190
00:16:30,620 --> 00:16:32,722
allow me to find Silla a way out.

191
00:16:38,094 --> 00:16:40,496
Even if you die by Yeon Gae So Mun's hand?

192
00:16:44,166 --> 00:16:46,235
I am already dead.

193
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:49,272
I will risk my own life...

194
00:16:50,439 --> 00:16:52,308
to find a way for Silla to live.

195
00:17:08,224 --> 00:17:11,093
You should send Lord Kim Chun Chu
to Pyongyangseong.

196
00:17:21,971 --> 00:17:23,105
Bi Dam...

197
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:27,610
wishes for Chun Chu
to die by Yeon Gae So Mun's hand.

198
00:17:33,049 --> 00:17:35,117
If that is what Lord Bi Dam wishes,

199
00:17:36,886 --> 00:17:38,854
I will allow you to go to Pyongyangseong.

200
00:17:43,225 --> 00:17:46,128
Pray fervently to Maitreya
before you leave.

201
00:17:50,366 --> 00:17:52,401
I do not pray anymore.

202
00:18:01,444 --> 00:18:03,479
I appoint Kim Chun Chu as an envoy.

203
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:06,716
Go to Pyongyangseong, make peace,

204
00:18:07,216 --> 00:18:09,385
and bring an army to attack Baekje with.

205
00:18:10,853 --> 00:18:13,589
Risk your life to obey my command,

206
00:18:14,023 --> 00:18:16,993
and atone for Daeyaseong's fall.

207
00:18:19,528 --> 00:18:20,730
Yes, Your Majesty.

208
00:18:41,651 --> 00:18:43,986
(Silla-Goguryeo border, Kim Yu Sin's camp)

209
00:18:47,490 --> 00:18:49,258
Do you also think...

210
00:18:49,325 --> 00:18:52,261
I am going to Goguryeo
as a crazy attempt to get revenge?

211
00:18:53,763 --> 00:18:55,297
Only crazy people go to war...

212
00:18:56,065 --> 00:18:57,900
and change the world.

213
00:18:59,468 --> 00:19:01,804
I understand you.

214
00:19:04,674 --> 00:19:06,909
I was able to understand the people...

215
00:19:07,977 --> 00:19:10,112
only after I lost my daughter.

216
00:19:12,314 --> 00:19:15,217
I will do whatever it takes
to make peace with Goguryeo,

217
00:19:15,284 --> 00:19:17,953
crush Baekje, and save Silla.

218
00:19:20,356 --> 00:19:22,792
I want to save the people from suffering.

219
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:26,128
Even if we make peace with Goguryeo,

220
00:19:26,796 --> 00:19:28,798
there can be no peace...

221
00:19:29,365 --> 00:19:31,400
until every enemy has been vanquished.

222
00:19:33,936 --> 00:19:35,404
If you cannot bear to see war,

223
00:19:36,072 --> 00:19:37,306
death is an option.

224
00:19:40,376 --> 00:19:43,612
Yeon Gae So Mun
will surely try to kill you.

225
00:19:44,513 --> 00:19:46,949
He will behead you or tear you apart.

226
00:19:49,685 --> 00:19:50,686
Be honest.

227
00:19:51,387 --> 00:19:52,588
Are you not afraid?

228
00:19:54,223 --> 00:19:56,092
I would be if I were you.

229
00:19:58,494 --> 00:19:59,695
I am afraid.

230
00:20:01,430 --> 00:20:03,299
However, I am already a dead man.

231
00:20:04,767 --> 00:20:06,302
When Go Ta So died,

232
00:20:08,204 --> 00:20:09,505
I died too.

233
00:20:25,321 --> 00:20:26,522
What is that?

234
00:20:29,792 --> 00:20:30,793
Could it be?

235
00:20:32,695 --> 00:20:35,030
I asked my wife to get it for me.

236
00:20:36,165 --> 00:20:38,567
I refuse to become
Yeon Gae So Mun's hostage...

237
00:20:39,535 --> 00:20:41,804
and become a hindrance to Silla.

238
00:20:44,273 --> 00:20:45,775
You are truly ruthless.

239
00:20:46,876 --> 00:20:49,011
How could you ask such a thing of Mun Hui
when she has just lost her daughter?

240
00:20:49,378 --> 00:20:51,280
A man desperate to live
will feel intimidated...

241
00:20:51,347 --> 00:20:54,850
in Yeon Gae So Mun's presence
and spew nonsense.

242
00:20:56,051 --> 00:20:57,119
But not I.

243
00:20:59,388 --> 00:21:01,524
This is the only way to convince him.

244
00:21:02,358 --> 00:21:04,426
How will you convince him?

245
00:21:05,561 --> 00:21:07,263
We have nothing he wants.

246
00:21:07,930 --> 00:21:12,868
I will find something to bargain with
before I reach Pyongyangseong.

247
00:21:14,804 --> 00:21:17,306
Goguryeo will be etched
into the wisp of every wind...

248
00:21:18,374 --> 00:21:20,409
and leaf of every plant.

249
00:21:27,116 --> 00:21:30,219
If I do not return,
have Beop Min and In Mun...

250
00:21:30,286 --> 00:21:31,620
That will not happen.

251
00:21:33,022 --> 00:21:35,024
I will break into Pyongyangseong
if I must...

252
00:21:35,791 --> 00:21:37,026
to get you back.

253
00:21:45,100 --> 00:21:48,103
Then I shall deal with Yeon Gae So Mun
without a worry.

254
00:21:58,280 --> 00:22:00,950
(Okmungok Valley,
southernmost border of Silla)

255
00:22:07,790 --> 00:22:09,491
I am sick and tired of this.

256
00:22:10,192 --> 00:22:11,727
Look at them.

257
00:22:13,329 --> 00:22:14,897
You will not last a day here.

258
00:22:15,130 --> 00:22:16,131
Why bother coming?

259
00:22:17,433 --> 00:22:18,434
Oh, well.

260
00:22:18,500 --> 00:22:19,735
Move faster!

261
00:22:20,369 --> 00:22:22,504
Come on! Assign the newcomers!

262
00:22:22,705 --> 00:22:23,706
Yes, sir!

263
00:22:24,306 --> 00:22:25,541
- Arrows!
- We are under attack!

264
00:22:25,608 --> 00:22:26,909
- We are under attack!
- Take cover!

265
00:23:06,649 --> 00:23:09,318
Every day we bury corpses,
only to come back as corpses ourselves.

266
00:23:11,987 --> 00:23:14,290
Hey, you. What are you doing here?

267
00:23:16,725 --> 00:23:18,127
You got dragged here, I suspect.

268
00:23:19,929 --> 00:23:21,163
Here is a secret.

269
00:23:23,766 --> 00:23:26,201
Obey General Su Se, and you die.

270
00:23:26,635 --> 00:23:29,672
If you want to live,
follow an experienced Rank 6 officer.

271
00:23:30,306 --> 00:23:31,307
Got that?

272
00:23:32,107 --> 00:23:35,344
All nobles other than Kim Yu Sin
are idiots!

273
00:23:52,361 --> 00:23:53,629
Stay down, you madman!

274
00:24:19,788 --> 00:24:21,156
We are down here,

275
00:24:22,825 --> 00:24:24,259
yet we are attacking Baekje
up in the north?

276
00:24:38,707 --> 00:24:41,243
(Near Pyongyangseong, Goguryeo)

277
00:24:59,695 --> 00:25:00,729
Who are you?

278
00:25:13,675 --> 00:25:14,676
Child.

279
00:25:15,310 --> 00:25:18,013
Which is the shortest way
to Pyongyangseong?

280
00:25:18,247 --> 00:25:20,649
This path will take you there.

281
00:25:34,196 --> 00:25:37,966
Why are the soldiers taking all the grain?

282
00:25:38,033 --> 00:25:39,034
Do you not know?

283
00:25:39,334 --> 00:25:42,204
It is to ensure our enemies starve
when they invade.

284
00:25:42,971 --> 00:25:45,808
Our Supreme Commander
is making us practice...

285
00:25:45,874 --> 00:25:48,277
moving the grain to the fortress
in case Tang attacks.

286
00:25:53,782 --> 00:25:54,817
I see.

287
00:25:57,119 --> 00:25:58,821
Let us ride on.

288
00:26:56,812 --> 00:26:58,881
(Geom Mo Jam, Goguryeo's general)

289
00:27:01,683 --> 00:27:04,786
Get off your horse and walk
to Pyongyangseong from here.

290
00:27:05,888 --> 00:27:08,457
We cannot permit
an enemy envoy to ride on horseback.

291
00:27:13,195 --> 00:27:14,396
Show proper etiquette.

292
00:27:19,034 --> 00:27:21,303
Is threatening and intimidating
an envoy...

293
00:27:22,638 --> 00:27:24,273
what Goguryeo calls etiquette?

294
00:27:25,941 --> 00:27:27,809
I represent the Queen of Silla.

295
00:27:28,877 --> 00:27:30,712
For her honor and dignity,

296
00:27:32,514 --> 00:27:34,149
I insist on riding to Pyongyangseong.

297
00:27:35,250 --> 00:27:36,318
If you will not permit it,

298
00:27:37,286 --> 00:27:39,054
then strike me down.

299
00:27:52,935 --> 00:27:55,304
(Yeon Gae So Mun,
Goguryeo's Grand Chancellor)

300
00:28:07,049 --> 00:28:08,717
You cannot do this!

301
00:28:09,051 --> 00:28:11,620
- What are you doing?
- Move out of my way.

302
00:28:11,687 --> 00:28:13,789
- This is absurd.
- Move out!

303
00:28:15,257 --> 00:28:16,925
Take that down.

304
00:28:16,992 --> 00:28:18,827
Do you know who I am?

305
00:28:18,894 --> 00:28:20,162
You fools!

306
00:28:20,829 --> 00:28:22,497
Let me through!

307
00:28:22,564 --> 00:28:24,266
How dare you?

308
00:28:29,705 --> 00:28:31,540
(Goguryeo's enemy, Tang)

309
00:28:31,607 --> 00:28:33,408
(Goguryeo's enemy, Ko Geon Mu)

310
00:28:33,475 --> 00:28:37,112
The emperor will punish you for this.

311
00:28:38,413 --> 00:28:40,782
I will report this in detail...

312
00:28:41,350 --> 00:28:43,151
and ensure you pay!

313
00:28:43,518 --> 00:28:44,653
You fools!

314
00:28:50,859 --> 00:28:52,027
You fools!

315
00:28:53,262 --> 00:28:54,429
Your Majesty.

316
00:28:54,830 --> 00:28:57,633
Silla's envoy, Kim Chun Chu, is entering.

317
00:29:23,592 --> 00:29:24,860
(Ko Jeong Eui, Goguryeo's general)

318
00:29:24,926 --> 00:29:26,361
(Yeon Jeong To, Goguryeo's general,
Yeon Gae So Mun's brother)

319
00:29:29,298 --> 00:29:30,299
Lord Chun Chu.

320
00:29:30,932 --> 00:29:33,168
The journey must have been arduous.

321
00:29:33,702 --> 00:29:35,304
Thank you for the welcome.

322
00:29:40,976 --> 00:29:43,011
(King Bojang, 28th ruler of Goguryeo)

323
00:29:48,283 --> 00:29:51,753
Grand Chancellor
and Supreme Commander of Goguryeo,

324
00:29:51,820 --> 00:29:53,789
Yeon Gae So Mun, is entering!

325
00:30:52,581 --> 00:30:53,582
Your Majesty.

326
00:30:54,816 --> 00:30:56,218
I, Kim Chun Chu,

327
00:30:56,985 --> 00:31:00,288
stand before you
at the command of the Queen of Silla.

328
00:31:00,589 --> 00:31:01,590
Welcome.

329
00:31:01,957 --> 00:31:03,558
And what command brings you here?

330
00:31:03,759 --> 00:31:05,327
You must be aware...

331
00:31:05,861 --> 00:31:07,462
that Goguryeo, Baekje, and Silla...

332
00:31:07,796 --> 00:31:10,999
kept things balanced
like three legs of a stool.

333
00:31:11,933 --> 00:31:15,070
However, lawless Baekje
has invaded Silla's territory,

334
00:31:15,470 --> 00:31:16,838
threatening that balance...

335
00:31:17,205 --> 00:31:19,241
and plunging this land into peril.

336
00:31:20,509 --> 00:31:22,310
May Your Great Majesty...

337
00:31:22,978 --> 00:31:25,046
forge peace with Silla...

338
00:31:26,014 --> 00:31:28,116
and grant us troops to strike Baekje...

339
00:31:28,917 --> 00:31:31,319
so that balance may be restored.

340
00:31:32,988 --> 00:31:37,292
It is every nation's dream
to expand its territory.

341
00:31:37,893 --> 00:31:40,629
By what right do you call Baekje lawless?

342
00:31:41,563 --> 00:31:43,799
I shall give you an example.

343
00:31:44,933 --> 00:31:46,902
Your Majesty surely recalls...

344
00:31:47,669 --> 00:31:51,106
how Baekje once sent envoys to Sui
urging them to invade Goguryeo.

345
00:31:52,073 --> 00:31:53,775
Goguryeo suffered great turmoil...

346
00:31:54,276 --> 00:31:56,711
in the ensuing attack.

347
00:32:00,949 --> 00:32:02,517
Was it you who suffered?

348
00:32:04,386 --> 00:32:05,387
Your Majesty.

349
00:32:05,987 --> 00:32:07,756
Baekje's invasion of Silla...

350
00:32:08,190 --> 00:32:10,258
made me see and feel the pain.

351
00:32:13,028 --> 00:32:14,963
You are a remarkably insolent man.

352
00:32:16,932 --> 00:32:20,936
First, you ignore
the man asking you questions.

353
00:32:21,002 --> 00:32:22,904
Second,

354
00:32:22,971 --> 00:32:27,876
you insist on answering
the one who never asked anything.

355
00:32:29,244 --> 00:32:31,079
Have you always been this insolent?

356
00:32:34,249 --> 00:32:36,351
Or are you belittling me?

357
00:32:49,731 --> 00:32:52,267
Forgive my insolence.

358
00:32:53,468 --> 00:32:54,469
However, I am here...

359
00:32:55,303 --> 00:32:57,105
representing the Queen of Silla,

360
00:32:57,172 --> 00:33:00,275
and I was commanded
to relay a message to Your Majesty.

361
00:33:00,742 --> 00:33:04,246
I do not have the authority
to answer another without permission.

362
00:33:08,283 --> 00:33:10,118
With your permission,

363
00:33:11,586 --> 00:33:13,889
I will answer the Grand Chancellor.

364
00:33:15,323 --> 00:33:16,324
You may.

365
00:33:16,658 --> 00:33:17,659
I do not mind.

366
00:33:26,101 --> 00:33:29,905
Grand Chancellor, do you not think
he is being polite enough?

367
00:33:31,606 --> 00:33:33,408
Do you really think so,

368
00:33:34,276 --> 00:33:35,277
Your Majesty?

369
00:33:37,479 --> 00:33:40,549
Silla's etiquette
is so different from ours.

370
00:33:40,949 --> 00:33:44,419
How could we make peace with them
and call them an ally?

371
00:33:51,226 --> 00:33:54,229
I also felt we were vastly different...

372
00:33:54,829 --> 00:33:57,465
when I entered Pyongyangseong.

373
00:33:58,700 --> 00:34:01,503
But that is trivial compared
to the benefit we could both enjoy,

374
00:34:02,370 --> 00:34:03,538
so I forgot all about it.

375
00:34:25,493 --> 00:34:27,862
Oh, Kim Chun Chu.

376
00:34:28,730 --> 00:34:30,131
I have heard of your prowess.

377
00:34:44,813 --> 00:34:45,814
So,

378
00:34:46,381 --> 00:34:50,685
what danger would Goguryeo face
if the power balance were broken?

379
00:34:53,788 --> 00:34:57,726
The emperor will punish you for this.

380
00:34:58,126 --> 00:35:00,428
I will report this in detail...

381
00:35:00,629 --> 00:35:02,397
and ensure you pay!

382
00:35:04,032 --> 00:35:05,033
Yes.

383
00:35:06,267 --> 00:35:08,937
Should Baekje widen the war,

384
00:35:09,604 --> 00:35:11,072
Tang and the northern forces...

385
00:35:12,040 --> 00:35:14,843
will consider it a threat
and decide to intervene.

386
00:35:16,544 --> 00:35:17,646
And which of the three nations...

387
00:35:18,647 --> 00:35:21,616
has a border to the north?

388
00:35:26,788 --> 00:35:28,723
Are you saying Goguryeo will be attacked?

389
00:35:30,291 --> 00:35:34,095
If you were to prepare
to go to war against Tang,

390
00:35:41,236 --> 00:35:43,171
what would you need the most?

391
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:48,943
A war between Goguryeo and Tang?

392
00:35:54,182 --> 00:35:56,885
Is that what you want?

393
00:35:59,354 --> 00:36:01,523
I swear to the heavens it is not.

394
00:36:02,691 --> 00:36:05,794
However, no one can see the future.

395
00:36:06,928 --> 00:36:08,830
If you join hands with Silla now,

396
00:36:09,998 --> 00:36:12,233
any enemy of Goguryeo
will also be an enemy of Silla,

397
00:36:12,600 --> 00:36:14,469
and you will have a backer in the south.

398
00:36:21,443 --> 00:36:23,645
If a stranger were to hear this,

399
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:26,815
they would think...

400
00:36:29,150 --> 00:36:30,952
Goguryeo was pleading for help.

401
00:36:33,521 --> 00:36:34,723
I am a man...

402
00:36:36,124 --> 00:36:38,093
who only believes what he sees.

403
00:36:40,462 --> 00:36:41,963
Provisions will be crucial.

404
00:36:45,567 --> 00:36:48,737
Baekje has the most fertile plains.

405
00:36:50,305 --> 00:36:53,475
They harvest several times
as much grain as Silla.

406
00:36:55,376 --> 00:36:57,846
If you ally with us
and deploy your troops...

407
00:36:57,912 --> 00:37:01,983
Why do you keep asking us to save you?

408
00:37:03,485 --> 00:37:04,486
Not at all.

409
00:37:05,920 --> 00:37:07,822
This will save you.

410
00:37:17,098 --> 00:37:20,869
The long wars have made Liaodong barren.

411
00:37:21,569 --> 00:37:26,141
If you were to gift them
grain from Baekje,

412
00:37:26,207 --> 00:37:29,511
they would revere and respect you too.

413
00:37:43,291 --> 00:37:44,559
Are you saying...

414
00:37:45,460 --> 00:37:47,362
I failed to subdue...

415
00:37:48,630 --> 00:37:50,999
the rulers and people of Liaodong?

416
00:37:58,273 --> 00:38:02,443
If I have offended you,
it is due to my lack of eloquence.

417
00:38:03,178 --> 00:38:04,946
Please forgive me.

418
00:38:07,949 --> 00:38:10,151
Do you wish to know our internal affairs?

419
00:38:11,786 --> 00:38:13,922
Do you enjoy looking...

420
00:38:15,423 --> 00:38:16,424
into my mind?

421
00:38:19,060 --> 00:38:21,396
You are mistaken, Supreme Commander.

422
00:38:26,100 --> 00:38:27,702
On your way to Pyongyangseong,

423
00:38:28,736 --> 00:38:32,307
you must have seen how we handle...

424
00:38:33,374 --> 00:38:35,710
those with ulterior motives.

425
00:38:40,215 --> 00:38:43,685
I came to beg for reinforcements
to save a falling nation.

426
00:38:44,319 --> 00:38:46,688
I do not dare have an ulterior motive.

427
00:38:49,357 --> 00:38:51,492
Without Goguryeo's help,

428
00:38:52,093 --> 00:38:53,928
Silla will surely fall.

429
00:38:56,598 --> 00:38:59,300
My lack of eloquence
has caused a misunderstanding.

430
00:39:05,039 --> 00:39:06,040
Supreme Commander,

431
00:39:06,908 --> 00:39:07,909
forgive me.

432
00:39:09,878 --> 00:39:11,512
Please forgive me.

433
00:39:12,647 --> 00:39:16,017
Please save Silla.

434
00:39:48,816 --> 00:39:51,152
How dare you!

435
00:39:59,427 --> 00:40:01,763
You can feign cowardice,

436
00:40:02,497 --> 00:40:04,532
but you cannot feign courage.

437
00:40:05,767 --> 00:40:08,736
We treated you as an envoy,
yet you act like a spy.

438
00:40:10,238 --> 00:40:15,476
You are even craftier than the rumors say.

439
00:40:17,879 --> 00:40:18,880
Here, today,

440
00:40:19,948 --> 00:40:21,516
Goguryeo...

441
00:40:22,583 --> 00:40:24,886
demands your head.

442
00:40:59,287 --> 00:41:00,455
Do you want to live?

443
00:41:03,157 --> 00:41:05,360
Even if I die, I want to save Silla.

444
00:41:05,426 --> 00:41:07,762
You think you can do that
with a few words?

445
00:41:07,829 --> 00:41:08,830
Also,

446
00:41:09,497 --> 00:41:11,232
I wished to save Goguryeo.

447
00:41:13,201 --> 00:41:15,069
Enemies on the inside
are like hidden reefs.

448
00:41:16,337 --> 00:41:19,907
You must subdue Liaodong
before going to war with Tang...

449
00:41:19,974 --> 00:41:21,442
to prevent internal strife.

450
00:41:23,077 --> 00:41:24,846
Silla can only survive if Goguryeo does.

451
00:41:25,680 --> 00:41:28,950
You must be well aware of that fact.

452
00:41:49,804 --> 00:41:52,607
He risked his own life to come here!

453
00:41:53,474 --> 00:41:58,179
That is why he does not fear my sword!

454
00:42:10,992 --> 00:42:11,993
Why...

455
00:42:13,194 --> 00:42:16,497
Why do you tell me to take the hard road
when an easy one lies right before me?

456
00:42:18,232 --> 00:42:21,135
Would it not be easier for me...

457
00:42:22,070 --> 00:42:27,041
to take you hostage and demand Silla
send provisions than invade Baekje?

458
00:42:39,921 --> 00:42:42,123
The old Queen
will lose her mind in fear...

459
00:42:43,124 --> 00:42:45,359
if she cannot tell
if you are dead or alive,

460
00:42:46,394 --> 00:42:49,363
and it would plunge Silla into turmoil.

461
00:42:57,038 --> 00:42:59,874
How enjoyable would that be?

462
00:43:07,748 --> 00:43:08,850
Do not just stand there.

463
00:43:10,518 --> 00:43:11,886
Take him away.

464
00:43:12,753 --> 00:43:13,754
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

465
00:44:24,592 --> 00:44:27,061
(Okmungok Valley,
southernmost border of Silla)

466
00:44:28,629 --> 00:44:29,897
You Silla fools!

467
00:44:30,198 --> 00:44:31,766
Die!

468
00:44:33,134 --> 00:44:35,670
Kill all the Baekje bastards!

469
00:44:46,080 --> 00:44:48,916
All men, advance!

470
00:46:11,899 --> 00:46:13,601
Is this it for me?

471
00:46:50,404 --> 00:46:51,405
Get up!

472
00:46:52,540 --> 00:46:54,775
Get up and run!

473
00:46:58,779 --> 00:46:59,814
Move!

474
00:47:06,454 --> 00:47:08,456
(Seol Oh Yu, Silla officer, Rank 6)

475
00:47:13,461 --> 00:47:14,462
Watch out!

476
00:47:26,640 --> 00:47:27,641
Thank you.

477
00:47:29,076 --> 00:47:31,946
I will kill you myself
if you break formation again.

478
00:47:37,318 --> 00:47:40,287
Why would he waste energy
saving the likes of him?

479
00:47:40,354 --> 00:47:41,422
Come on, Father!

480
00:47:41,489 --> 00:47:44,658
They say the luckiest man
lasts the longest on a battlefield!

481
00:47:44,725 --> 00:47:46,260
Whose son are you?

482
00:47:46,327 --> 00:47:48,596
You are too smart for your own good!

483
00:47:55,202 --> 00:47:56,470
Advance!

484
00:47:57,772 --> 00:47:59,340
We are the defense line.

485
00:48:00,775 --> 00:48:03,811
Why are we attacking uphill
at a disadvantage?

486
00:48:06,447 --> 00:48:07,815
Just do as you are told.

487
00:48:07,882 --> 00:48:08,883
Advance!

488
00:48:11,819 --> 00:48:12,820
Men!

489
00:48:13,120 --> 00:48:14,688
Prepare to advance!

490
00:48:15,222 --> 00:48:16,223
Come on!

491
00:48:18,459 --> 00:48:19,627
Advance!

492
00:48:24,064 --> 00:48:25,132
Come on. Move!

493
00:48:40,714 --> 00:48:44,084
I heard you are Kim Chun Chu of Silla.

494
00:48:48,589 --> 00:48:49,590
I am.

495
00:48:50,124 --> 00:48:52,326
I am Seon Do Hae.

496
00:48:56,630 --> 00:48:58,032
Wait, you...

497
00:48:58,866 --> 00:49:01,302
You came to Seorabeol
as an envoy several years ago.

498
00:49:04,271 --> 00:49:07,374
Despite my sorry state,

499
00:49:08,108 --> 00:49:10,811
your eyes are sharp as ever.

500
00:49:13,080 --> 00:49:15,616
Your eyes tell me
you will not die anytime soon.

501
00:49:15,683 --> 00:49:18,452
Do not say that.

502
00:49:19,453 --> 00:49:21,088
Death is the only way out of here.

503
00:49:22,423 --> 00:49:23,524
Why did you...

504
00:49:23,991 --> 00:49:27,995
come here to see Yeon Gae So Mun
and suffer such disgrace?

505
00:49:29,563 --> 00:49:32,600
Negotiations must be done
with a human being.

506
00:49:34,568 --> 00:49:36,804
Paths are made where there are none.

507
00:49:41,775 --> 00:49:44,578
The heavens must have kept me alive...

508
00:49:44,879 --> 00:49:47,581
so I could save your life.

509
00:49:50,985 --> 00:49:54,154
The enemy of my enemy is an ally.

510
00:49:55,189 --> 00:49:58,592
I know of a way to get you out of here.

511
00:50:01,495 --> 00:50:02,596
You do?

512
00:50:04,131 --> 00:50:05,900
The land north of Jungnyeong.

513
00:50:06,734 --> 00:50:09,670
That is your only lifeline.

514
00:50:13,807 --> 00:50:17,378
A subject cannot give away
his monarch's land.

515
00:50:18,679 --> 00:50:20,147
Without that land,

516
00:50:20,981 --> 00:50:22,583
Silla will also fall.

517
00:50:23,884 --> 00:50:27,421
I was told
you had the brightest mind in Silla.

518
00:50:27,821 --> 00:50:29,490
Why are you so slow to understand?

519
00:50:30,524 --> 00:50:35,095
You have less wit than the rabbit
that gave up its liver to escape danger.

520
00:50:52,012 --> 00:50:54,281
(Goguryeo's enemy)

521
00:51:15,102 --> 00:51:16,103
Jeong To.

522
00:51:17,371 --> 00:51:19,340
Why were you in such a rush...

523
00:51:20,608 --> 00:51:23,611
to strike Crown Prince
Ko Hwan Gwon's head?

524
00:51:25,412 --> 00:51:29,083
Do you know
why I only cut half his throat?

525
00:51:30,284 --> 00:51:32,019
I wanted to see...

526
00:51:32,486 --> 00:51:37,424
what he would say about his dead father
when he could barely speak.

527
00:51:38,158 --> 00:51:39,259
I was flustered.

528
00:51:40,761 --> 00:51:42,630
I forgot your command...

529
00:51:43,564 --> 00:51:44,565
that he should not be killed.

530
00:51:47,067 --> 00:51:48,802
The fools...

531
00:51:49,169 --> 00:51:52,506
who prattled before me without knowing
the ways of the world were...

532
00:51:53,641 --> 00:51:56,210
Ko Geon Mu and the Crown Prince.

533
00:51:57,878 --> 00:51:59,446
Who will be next?

534
00:52:00,748 --> 00:52:01,782
Oh, right.

535
00:52:02,650 --> 00:52:04,018
Kim Chun Chu.

536
00:52:06,920 --> 00:52:08,622
Yes, Kim Chun Chu.

537
00:52:15,362 --> 00:52:20,067
The looks of desperation
in the eyes of the men I struck down.

538
00:52:21,835 --> 00:52:23,037
You know,

539
00:52:24,772 --> 00:52:26,707
they act all noble and hide it,

540
00:52:28,008 --> 00:52:31,445
but they all want to shed blood too.

541
00:52:33,681 --> 00:52:36,884
Politics is no different.

542
00:52:38,952 --> 00:52:42,489
You will learn one day how to win.

543
00:52:45,526 --> 00:52:48,729
I wish to follow in your footsteps.

544
00:52:50,531 --> 00:52:51,732
You should,

545
00:52:52,666 --> 00:52:54,468
for my children.

546
00:52:55,202 --> 00:52:57,938
I need you to teach them.

547
00:52:59,440 --> 00:53:00,607
I want my sons...

548
00:53:02,309 --> 00:53:05,612
to revel in their enemies' pain.

549
00:53:07,314 --> 00:53:09,717
They must learn to enjoy it.

550
00:53:11,185 --> 00:53:12,286
Yes, Gae So Mun.

551
00:53:13,353 --> 00:53:14,621
I have brought Kim Chun Chu.

552
00:53:40,881 --> 00:53:42,816
You will return the land...

553
00:53:43,317 --> 00:53:46,019
north of Jungnyeong
that King Jinheung took from us, you say?

554
00:53:47,221 --> 00:53:49,790
Yes, that is right.

555
00:53:51,091 --> 00:53:54,161
If it means siding with you
and crushing Baekje,

556
00:53:55,329 --> 00:53:59,032
my Queen will willingly
hand over the land.

557
00:54:04,338 --> 00:54:06,440
I swear it on that sun.

558
00:54:11,044 --> 00:54:15,883
Those who are desperate to live
swear by the sun.

559
00:54:18,519 --> 00:54:19,520
I do not think...

560
00:54:20,554 --> 00:54:22,823
you can return that land that easily.

561
00:54:24,358 --> 00:54:27,828
What good is a patch of land
when a nation is at stake?

562
00:54:28,695 --> 00:54:30,164
Also, my Queen...

563
00:54:30,864 --> 00:54:32,766
will stop at nothing to save me.

564
00:54:34,768 --> 00:54:36,470
Please believe me.

565
00:54:51,919 --> 00:54:53,020
Lord Chun Chu.

566
00:55:02,262 --> 00:55:03,730
Oh, Chun Chu...

567
00:55:06,767 --> 00:55:08,068
It seems 60 days in here...

568
00:55:10,537 --> 00:55:12,673
have worn you down.

569
00:55:17,144 --> 00:55:18,145
Very well.

570
00:55:19,046 --> 00:55:20,614
I will spare your life.

571
00:55:21,815 --> 00:55:24,618
However, as soon as you return,

572
00:55:25,252 --> 00:55:28,622
you must hand over
the land north of Jungnyeong.

573
00:55:29,857 --> 00:55:32,793
If anything goes against our agreement
in the slightest,

574
00:55:35,329 --> 00:55:37,631
I will ruin Seorabeol myself.

575
00:55:38,298 --> 00:55:42,836
My men will stick arrows and spears
in your Queen's body...

576
00:55:43,070 --> 00:55:45,339
and make her a living scarecrow.

577
00:55:47,307 --> 00:55:51,111
And I heard your wife is a great beauty.

578
00:55:51,545 --> 00:55:57,017
My men will take her until her silk robes
are ripped and her body is worn.

579
00:55:57,484 --> 00:55:58,852
That is what will happen.

580
00:55:59,486 --> 00:56:00,821
Your children...

581
00:56:01,755 --> 00:56:03,957
will be thrown alive to dogs.

582
00:56:05,225 --> 00:56:07,895
You will be forced to watch as their flesh
is torn from their bones.

583
00:56:09,029 --> 00:56:10,097
Only...

584
00:56:11,665 --> 00:56:14,067
after you have watched
every last bit of it...

585
00:56:15,903 --> 00:56:17,170
will you draw...

586
00:56:20,674 --> 00:56:21,975
your final breath.

587
00:56:23,644 --> 00:56:24,978
Such is the weight of a promise.

588
00:56:26,680 --> 00:56:27,948
So keep your word.

589
00:56:35,088 --> 00:56:36,356
Once you get the land back,

590
00:56:37,190 --> 00:56:39,960
make peace with us
and send reinforcements immediately.

591
00:57:10,757 --> 00:57:13,160
Escort Lord Chun Chu to the border.

592
00:57:13,827 --> 00:57:14,895
Yes, sir.

593
00:57:37,217 --> 00:57:40,253
Yeon Gae So Mun is fickle.

594
00:57:40,988 --> 00:57:42,923
Cross the border as soon as you can.

595
00:57:47,060 --> 00:57:50,063
We have a long way to go. Can we speed up?

596
00:57:50,263 --> 00:57:51,465
It will tire the horses.

597
00:57:57,938 --> 00:57:58,939
Fine.

598
00:58:14,421 --> 00:58:17,190
Seon Do Hae was the one
who handed Kim Chun Chu the strategy.

599
00:58:35,308 --> 00:58:36,643
You fool!

600
00:58:38,445 --> 00:58:40,814
Did Seon Do Hae truly say such a thing?

601
00:58:41,381 --> 00:58:43,917
(Ko Hye Jin,
southern provincial governor of Goguryeo)

602
00:58:43,984 --> 00:58:46,186
I heard it clearly with my own ears.

603
00:58:47,020 --> 00:58:50,424
He said the land north of Jungnyeong
is what you wanted.

604
00:58:50,757 --> 00:58:52,125
He said it time and again.

605
00:58:58,899 --> 00:59:00,200
I let you live...

606
00:59:02,135 --> 00:59:04,871
because you were a loyal subject.

607
00:59:06,306 --> 00:59:08,542
Why did you help Kim Chun Chu?

608
00:59:09,676 --> 00:59:11,611
You killed my friends and family.

609
00:59:12,012 --> 00:59:15,982
It is my wish
that your Goguryeo go down in flames.

610
00:59:17,451 --> 00:59:20,854
Kim Chun Chu will be the death of you.

611
00:59:25,325 --> 00:59:26,326
What did you say?

612
01:00:14,574 --> 01:00:17,010
Kim Chun Chu made a fool of me.

613
01:00:19,312 --> 01:00:20,981
I cannot let him leave.

614
01:00:26,586 --> 01:00:27,587
Get rid of him.

615
01:02:19,666 --> 01:02:21,968
(Goguryeo-Silla border)

616
01:02:36,449 --> 01:02:37,884
Why did you stop?

617
01:02:37,951 --> 01:02:40,920
Please run just a little farther.

618
01:02:43,790 --> 01:02:47,527
Are you handing me over to Yeon Gae So Mun
because you are Goguryeo's steed?

619
01:02:47,961 --> 01:02:48,962
Please.

620
01:02:49,629 --> 01:02:51,965
Please run just a little farther.

621
01:04:56,189 --> 01:04:58,758
(Kim Yu Sin, Silla's Supreme General)

622
01:06:37,323 --> 01:06:39,325
Lord Kim Chun Chu!

623
01:06:40,126 --> 01:06:43,129
Why did you leave
without allowing me to see you off?

624
01:06:44,664 --> 01:06:46,633
I will not forget...

625
01:06:48,101 --> 01:06:50,503
your hospitality!

626
01:07:04,918 --> 01:07:05,985
Load!

627
01:07:44,257 --> 01:07:46,960
(Sword & Silence)

628
01:08:15,421 --> 01:08:16,756
Who are you?

629
01:08:16,956 --> 01:08:18,391
Perhaps you will find out one day.

630
01:08:18,725 --> 01:08:20,994
Was Yeon Gae So Mun as crazy as they say?

631
01:08:21,060 --> 01:08:22,495
He was more like a tiger.

632
01:08:23,096 --> 01:08:24,530
Secure a route to Seorabeol!

633
01:08:24,597 --> 01:08:26,232
An army of 30,000 Baekje troops
is on its way.

634
01:08:26,566 --> 01:08:28,167
I will tear apart the skies of Tang...

635
01:08:28,635 --> 01:08:31,104
and extinguish its sun.

636
01:08:31,704 --> 01:08:34,040
I promise to save Silla.

637
01:08:34,540 --> 01:08:36,109
Give me your name before we die.

638
01:08:36,776 --> 01:08:37,777
Beop Min.
